WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.542
Eddy drove into the car wash.

2
00:00:20.543 --> 00:00:24.458
Hiss! Wump! Wump! Wump!

3
00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:29.669
The building was noisy.

4
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:35.879
Water splashed on Eddy.

5
00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:41.703
"Whoa!" he said.

6
00:00:41.704 --> 00:00:46.128
Bubbles were everywhere.

7
00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:49.755
Big brushes spun.

8
00:00:49.756 --> 00:00:52.573
They cleaned his sides.

9
00:00:52.574 --> 00:00:58.377
The brushes cleaned Eddy's top.

10
00:00:58.378 --> 00:01:01.463
They cleaned his tires.

11
00:01:01.464 --> 00:01:04.223
Eddy laughed.

12
00:01:04.224 --> 00:01:06.384
"That tickles!"

13
00:01:06.385 --> 00:01:09.083
More water sprayed.

14
00:01:09.084 --> 00:01:14.965
Suds dripped off Eddy.

15
00:01:14.966 --> 00:01:27.544
Eddy came out of the car wash.

16
00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:33.547
"That was fun!" he said.

17
00:01:33.548 --> 00:01:37.061
"Who will go next?" Mr. Grill asked.

18
00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:49.211
"Me!" the students shouted.

19
00:01:49.212 --> 00:01:52.215
Everyone got clean.

20
00:01:52.216 --> 00:01:54.781
Even Jeb sparkled.

21
00:01:54.782 --> 00:02:01.952
"I love the car wash!" he said.

22
00:02:01.953 --> 00:02:05.375
Finally it was Poppy's turn.

23
00:02:05.376 --> 00:02:07.822
Poppy frowned.

24
00:02:07.823 --> 00:02:13.952
"I am not going in there!"

